3. Conditions of use
   a. The records the studio reads are public court and government releases. Their redactions protect victims and
      parties a court withheld. You may not use this software, or data produced with it, to identify, or to publish a
      claim about the identity of, a person the records redact.
   b. A name on a page is a mention, nothing more. If you publish results produced with the studio, keep the page
      references with them and do not present a co-mention as a finding.
   c. Any copy you share, and any public use of results, carries the attribution "Built with The Epstein Files -
      Lion Studios by Sunny Chase, https://github.com/sunnychase/lion-epstein-files-studio".

